# Visualization of a Document Collection: The VIBE System.

**Authors:** Olsen, Kai A., And Others

## Abstract
Explores the use of visualization to enhance the information retrieval process, particularly in bibliographic retrieval systems. Topics discussed include document retrieval systems; human visualization; the VIBE (VIsualization by Example) system, a prototype system for visualizing a collection of documents; and differences between VIBE and more traditional retrieval systems. (14 references) (LRW)

